% The whole evidential basis for "brush last thing at night". SIGN 138
% reference 101: a one-page conference abstract, which SIGN itself
% describes as an observational study.
% Entered as a conference abstract, not an article, because that is what it
% is: one page in a congress supplement, with no full report, no DOI and no
% PubMed record. That is not a bibliographic quibble. It is the entire
% evidential basis for a Strong recommendation, and the fact that it cannot
% be given a persistent identifier is part of the finding.
